            // CONSTANT IS A CONSTANT Rhs, and golden reads it as one.
            //
            // § genCaConstRhsLhsNoBind25 above is keyed on the INSTALLED Rhs
            // ("it reads only the INSTALLED Rhs", its own note says), and a
