    // Grid tools/probe/r11u137repro/grid/tn.  Switch:
    // R11U137_DEFNETTP_OFF.
    // § defNetTypeParamPackedDim144 (r11u144) — the same binding for a
    // type-parameter name carrying PACKED dimensions (`dtype [FifoDepth-1:0]
